    "detailed_description": "Discover the ultimate challenge in hidden object gaming with HiddenSet! In this game, your mission is to find hidden color combinations to recreate the original design on a cube. In advanced mode, these combinations can be rotated at various angles, adding to the complexity.<br><br>The game features a dynamic rewards system with both positive and negative bonuses:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Positive Bonuses: reveal hidden elements, group colors, extend time, gain extra lives, and boost your score.<br></li><li> Negative Bonuses: hide elements, reduce time, life count, and score.</li></ul>Time is limited for both finding hidden color combinations and collecting positive bonuses. Additionally, the cube's colored elements may shuffle automatically over time, keeping you on your toes.<br><br>Customize your gameplay by adjusting the difficulty level and the cube's size. The larger the cube, the tougher the challenge!<br><br>Ready for a real test of your hidden object game skills? Dive into HiddenSet now and see if you have what it takes to master the color cube!",
    "about_the_game": "Discover the ultimate challenge in hidden object gaming with HiddenSet! In this game, your mission is to find hidden color combinations to recreate the original design on a cube. In advanced mode, these combinations can be rotated at various angles, adding to the complexity.<br><br>The game features a dynamic rewards system with both positive and negative bonuses:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Positive Bonuses: reveal hidden elements, group colors, extend time, gain extra lives, and boost your score.<br></li><li> Negative Bonuses: hide elements, reduce time, life count, and score.</li></ul>Time is limited for both finding hidden color combinations and collecting positive bonuses. Additionally, the cube's colored elements may shuffle automatically over time, keeping you on your toes.<br><br>Customize your gameplay by adjusting the difficulty level and the cube's size. The larger the cube, the tougher the challenge!<br><br>Ready for a real test of your hidden object game skills? Dive into HiddenSet now and see if you have what it takes to master the color cube!",
    "short_description": "Uncover hidden color combinations to recreate the original cube design. In advanced mode, combinations rotate at various angles. Enjoy dynamic bonuses and customizable difficulty for endless fun!",
